e physical demands of the fight  Alfred will be drawing him an ice bath  in no time the Man of Steel's weakness  is all mental and he's much quicker to  outrage and recklessness in his old age  but if Superman can keep his temper in  check an angular red s is the last thing  Batman will see these iconic versions of  Bruce and Clark rocked their own  universes as the ultimate heroes but who  will be left standing  when else worlds collide Batman or Super  Bowl let us know who you're betting on  in the comments below that's this week's  battle for the multiverse so head down  to the comments and tell us who you  think would win and why and we are  always looking for ideas for the next  verses so make sure you let us know who  you want to see faceoff next have a  great weekend and we'll see you next  time Superfriends bye-bye
 

